      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01236",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "\"怎么样？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Well, how does it feel?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01236",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "心里准有什么东西毁掉了吧？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Something inside you must have been destroyed, right?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01236",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "我是是忍受不了看到朋友抱着容易毁掉的东西而活着。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I simply cannot bear to see a friend go on living while clinging to something so easily destroyed.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01236",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "我的亲切表现，就是只顾把它毁掉。\"",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "My way of showing kindness is to do nothing but destroy it.\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
